 "summary": "The IXI-R2-230 drives two 230 V damper actuators and reads their open and closed end switches. Over BACnet it exposes each damper's relay command, position, moving and end-switch flags, a status code, test functions and the local manual-override input. Objects come in pairs, one per damper.",
