 "notes": [
  "The list heads its name column \"Description\"; those code-style texts are used as the object names.",
  "BV 4 and BV 5 are printed as \"Not In Use\" and are left out.",
  "The R/W cell of BV 16 is blank in the list; it is marked W like its twin BV 17.",
  "Damper position reads 0, 50 or 100 %.",
  "The object list does not state the BACnet transport."
 ],
